WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.225
Let’s walk through PLI SME Efficacy.

00:00:03.225 --> 00:00:06.737
On this slide, review session-level approve and override counts

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:09.787
plus the fields specialists change most often.

00:00:09.787 --> 00:00:12.875
In practice, use the aggregate as a codebook revision

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:13.650
signal;

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:18.525
it describes specialist outcomes and never changes an individual adjudication

00:00:18.525 --> 00:00:18.650
.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:22.188
When you are ready, use Open PLI SME Efficacy

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.113
to move to the live surface.

00:00:24.113 --> 00:00:26.850
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:27.000
.
